<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#241b4b"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Financial Planning for Contractors & Business Owners | RIPL Wealth</title><meta name="description" content="Looking for financial freedom? RIPL helps business owners put their money to work with coordinated tax-aware planning and investments."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Libre+Baskerville:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a href="#main" class="brand" aria-label="RIPL Wealth — top"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL" width="112" height="48"/><small>BUILD TOMORROW TODAY.</small></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="#services">What we do</a><a href="#about">Meet Adam</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#tax-evaluation">Free tax evaluation ↗</a></nav></div></header>
<main id="main">
<div class="hero-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span> FINANCIAL PLANNING FOR CONTRACTORS &amp; BUSINESS OWNERS</p><h1 id="hero-title">Save on taxes. <em>Optimize investments. Holistic view. Simple.</em></h1></div>
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="video-slot" id="intro-video"><div class="video-placeholder"><span class="play-circle" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><strong>Meet Adam · A quick introduction</strong><span>Playing from YouTube</span></div></div><div class="video-actions" aria-label="Three ways to start"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Question%20for%20Adam%20at%20RIPL" data-email>Email Adam a question →</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Schedule a 20-minute call →</a><a class="button outline" href="#tax-evaluation" data-tax-jump>Free tax evaluation ↓</a><p class="micro">Start with email, a 20-minute call, or a free tax evaluation. We’ll arrange secure sharing later, if appropriate.</p></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="lead">RIPL helps business owners explore tax-aware planning opportunities, invest with their goals in mind, and coordinate their CPA, insurance, estate plan and investments from one set of blueprints.</p><div class="stack hero-desktop-actions"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Question%20for%20Adam%20at%20RIPL" data-email>Email Adam a question →</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Schedule a 20-minute call →</a><a class="button outline" href="#tax-evaluation" data-tax-jump>Free tax evaluation ↓</a></div><p class="micro">Free. No obligation. We work alongside your CPA.</p></div></section>
<section class="section wrap quiz-section" id="quiz"><div class="quiz-shell"><div class="quiz-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE TWO-MINUTE QUIZ</p><h2>Is your money working <em>as hard as you do?</em></h2><p>This is your answer to figuring out what your needs are and what gaps may exist. Seven quick questions can highlight potential gaps in investments, tax planning, and your overall strategy.</p><p class="quiz-promise">No documents. No obligation. Immediate results.</p></div><span class="quiz-time">About 2 minutes</span></div><div id="quiz-progress" class="quiz-progress"><span id="step-label">Question 1 of 7</span><div class="track"><i id="progress-fill"></i></div></div><div id="quiz-content"><h3 class="question-title">{first.title}</h3><p class="hint">{first.hint}</p><div class="options">{first.options.map((a,i)=><button type="button" data-answer={i}>{a}</button>)}</div></div><p class="fine">Educational starting point only; not personalized investment, tax or legal advice.</p></div><section id="results" hidden aria-live="polite"></section></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="pillars"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE FOUNDATION</p><h2>Safe first. <em>Grow second.</em></h2></div><div class="pillar-grid"><article class="pillar safe"><span class="pill-label">01 / FOUNDATION</span><h3>Safe first.</h3><p>Before investing for growth, we review cash reserves, insurance needs and risks that could affect what you’ve built. The goal is a plan informed by your circumstances, not a promise against loss.</p></article><article class="pillar grow"><span class="pill-label">02 / BUILD</span><h3>Grow second.</h3><p>Once the foundation is in place, we evaluate investments based on your goals, timeline and tolerance for risk—not just a market benchmark. All investments involve risk.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK WE DO</p><h2>Financial planning that <em>speaks your language.</em></h2></div><div class="services">{services.map(([n,title,description],i)=><article><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{n}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section tools-bg"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">TWO TOOLS WORTH KNOWING ABOUT</p><h2>Two strategies that might help you put your money to work more effectively.</h2></div><div class="tool-grid"><article><p class="tag">TAX-AWARE INVESTING</p><h3>Direct Indexing</h3><p>Instead of buying a fund, you own the individual stocks inside it. When some of them drop, we can sell those to capture a loss that may offset gains elsewhere, while keeping you invested in the market. Similar broad market exposure, with more control over how taxable gains and losses are managed.</p><p class="risk"><em>Tax-loss harvesting does not guarantee a better outcome, and tax benefits depend on your situation. Talk with your CPA. Direct indexing can differ from an index and may involve additional costs.</em></p></article><article><p class="tag">DEFINED-OUTCOME INVESTMENTS</p><h3>Structured Notes</h3><p>Some money needs to grow without taking every hit the market throws. Certain structured notes can be designed for potential income or growth, with a buffer against specified market declines up to a defined point. The terms spell out how potential payments and losses are calculated.</p><p class="risk"><em>Structured notes are subject to the issuer's credit risk, can lose principal if markets fall past the protection level, may limit upside, and may be difficult to sell before maturity. Payments are not guaranteed.</em></p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap start" id="start"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">RECOMMENDED FIRST STEP</p><h2>Want the free tax evaluation? <em>Start here.</em></h2></div><article class="offer primary-offer" id="tax-evaluation"><span class="offer-kicker">RECOMMENDED FIRST STEP · EMAIL OR CALL</span><h3>Free tax evaluation.</h3><p>Let's begin with a quick email. Tell me you're interested in the free tax evaluation, and I'll reply with what I need and how the process works. You can handle the initial questions by email or choose a 20-minute call—whatever's easier.</p><p>If we decide to review your tax return, I'll arrange secure document sharing separately. Hazel may help identify planning opportunities for us to discuss alongside your CPA. This is not tax preparation, and savings are not guaranteed.</p><div class="secure-info"><span aria-hidden="true">♧</span><p><strong>Email or call first. Share documents securely later.</strong> Do not attach tax returns, Social Security numbers, or other sensitive documents to an ordinary email or submit them on this website.</p></div><div class="tax-contact-actions"><a class="button primary" id="tax-email-link" href="mailto:adam@riplwealth.com?subject=Free%20tax%20evaluation%20request&amp;body=Hi%20Adam%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20free%20tax%20evaluation.%20Please%20send%20me%20the%20next%20steps.%0A%0A%28I%20won%27t%20attach%20my%20tax%20return%20to%20this%20email.%29" data-tax-email>Email Adam to get started →</a><a class="button outline" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Prefer to talk? Book a 20-minute call →</a></div><p class="placeholder-note" id="upload-note">Adam will provide secure sharing instructions when appropriate.</p></article></section>
<section id="booking" class="booking"><div class="wrap booking-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET'S SHARE SOME GOOD IDEAS</p><h2>20 minutes. <em>A useful next step.</em></h2><p>No cheesy sales process. We’ll talk through what’s on your mind, the people already on your team, and what might need a closer look. If we decide to review a tax return, we’ll arrange secure sharing after the call.</p></div><div class="booking-action"><a id="booking-link" class="button primary" href="https://calendly.com/adam-riplwealth/30-minute-zoom-meeting" data-book data-book-type="call">Book my 20-minute call ↗</a><p id="booking-note" class="placeholder-note">We'll use this conversation to clarify your next step.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap about" id="about"><div class="about-photo"><img src="/money-at-work/images/adam.webp" alt="Adam Kasick, financial adviser at RIPL Wealth" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy"/><span>Adam Kasick · RIPL Wealth</span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ADAM</p><h2>A business owner <em>in your corner.</em></h2><p>I'm Adam Kasick with RIPL Wealth in Fort Collins. I'm a business owner too, so I know your time is valuable. No cheesy sales process. My goal is for you to leave our 20-minute conversation with a clearer next step, whether or not we ever talk again.</p><blockquote>Successful people make great decisions when they can see their options clearly.</blockquote><div class="credential"><strong>Experience you can verify</strong><p>Investment advisory services through RIPL Wealth, LLC, a registered investment adviser. Adam has passed the Series 7 and Series 66 securities examinations. Client accounts are custodied through Altruist.</p><p><a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify adviser registration ↗</a> <a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Check BrokerCheck ↗</a></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap library" id="videos"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE THINK ABOUT MONEY</p><h2>Questions real <em>owners ask.</em></h2><p>Short videos organized around where you are in building, growing, transitioning and using your wealth.</p></div><div class="video-filter" id="filters" aria-label="Video categories"><button type="button" class="active" data-stage="All" aria-pressed="true">All</button>{stages.map(s=><button type="button" data-stage={s} aria-pressed="false">{s}</button>)}</div><div id="video-grid" class="video-grid">{videos.map(v=><article class="video-card" data-video-stage={v.stage}><div class="video-thumb"><img loading="lazy" src={v.youtubeId?`https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.youtubeId}/hqdefault.jpg`:'/money-at-work/images/adam.webp'} alt=""/><span>{v.youtubeId?'▶':'Soon'}</span></div><div><span class="tag">{v.stage}</span><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.summary}</p>{v.youtubeId?<a href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${v.youtubeId}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the video ↗</a>:<span class="video-soon">Video coming soon</span>}<p class="risk">{v.risk}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap footer-top"><a class="footer-brand" href="#main"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" width="98" height="40" alt="RIPL Wealth"/></a><div><strong>RIPL Wealth, LLC</strong><p>Fort Collins, Colorado</p><a href="/money-at-work-privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="https://riplwealth.com/disclosures/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Disclosures</a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-disclosures"><p>RIPL Wealth is a registered investment adviser. Registration does not imply a certain level of skill or training. RIPL Wealth does not provide tax or legal advice; please consult your tax and legal professionals. Investing involves risk, including the possible loss of principal. No strategy can guarantee a profit, protect against loss, or ensure tax savings.</p><p>RIPL may coordinate with independent legal, tax, insurance, or other professionals. Any referral compensation or material conflicts, if applicable, should be disclosed in accordance with RIPL’s policies before a referral. <strong>Referral arrangements require compliance verification before publication.</strong> RIPL is not affiliated with or endorsed by FINRA, the SEC, Vanguard, or the other organizations mentioned.</p><p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} RIPL Wealth · Give every dollar a job.</p></div></footer>
